    <expertiseList>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/cade34d4eca648a49cb03d189e5c66de"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/dbf2c9c2c1a64ff1b93a8baa005b507b"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/bb034875095e49bd99cbfe2dc0320fe4"}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/cade34d4eca648a49cb03d189e5c66de","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Concrete Durability Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/dbf2c9c2c1a64ff1b93a8baa005b507b","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Concrete Strength Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/bb034875095e49bd99cbfe2dc0320fe4","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Concrete Mix Designs"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/48a206dcf3f34925887202bc127957fb","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/48a206dcf3f34925887202bc127957fb","content":"\u003cdiv class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"758bl\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs South Africa’s geographical center, the Free State is a crucial transport and infrastructure hub with growing renewable and municipal infrastructure. Our Bloemfontein laboratory is playing a critical role in the province by ensuring world-leading quality assurance standards through geotechnical and materials testing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith increasing demand for materials testing in the Free State we have expanded our footprint through a new branch in Welkom. This has already reduced turnaround times, lowered costs and enabled faster testing results.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/4i2doh3q/roadlab-bloemfontein-branch.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eOur long-standing facility in Bloemfontein will support our expanded operation in Welkom.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/zdwddi0c/free-state-projects.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eFrom Bloemfontein’s urban areas to the growing renewable energy hubs of Welkom, Virginia and Kimberley, we continue to provide industry-leading testing services that ensure quality, reliability, and compliance.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/k4aee3o4/free-state-renewable-projects.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRenewable Energy Expansion: Powering the Free State\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith South Africa’s growing investment in renewable energy, Roadlab Bloemfontein is ensuring quality and durability in the construction of major wind and solar farms across the province.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKoruson Renewable Energy Wind Farm (Middleburg)\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cbr\u003eRoadlab is providing ongoing control testing including plate load testing to determine the bearing capacity of turbine foundations and CBR testing for access road stability and foundation reinforcement.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGrasspan Solar Farm (Kimberley)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOur geotechnical and materials testing scope includes density testing for foundation compaction and soil stability and concrete cube strength testing \u003cbr\u003eto ensure structural integrity of solar panel bases.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpringbok Solar Farm (Welkom) - Completed\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe have successfully completed geotechnical and concrete strength testing investigations on this project, ensuring compliance with engineering and regulatory standards.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVirginia Solar Farm (Welkom) – New Appointment\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe were recently awarded control testing services for this newly built solar farm from March 2025.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/vrafpd4k/wind-farm-in-the-free-state.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/dufkhomc/concrete-for-wind-farms.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/seabe21q/concrete-testing-for-wind-farms.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/srjn4m0m/construction-for-free-state-municipalities.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSupporting Municipal \u0026amp; Infrastructure Development\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur geotechnical, soil, concrete and road testing services are employed across the Free State, playing a vital role in major municipal infrastructure projects. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThese are some of the projects we are currently working on in the Free State.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMangaung Metropolitan Municipality - Bloemfontein\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRoadlab Bloemfontein was awarded 66 km of geotechnical testing for the Integrated Public Transport Network (IPTN). We are currently providing geotechnical investigation services for Phase 1B \u0026amp; 1C of the network, ensuring the long-term durability of new road infrastructure. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMatjhabeng Local Municipality - Welkom\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe have conducted geotechnical investigations for the repair and unblocking of sewer networks, addressing aging and collapsed infrastructure in key areas such as Allanridge, Bronville, Flamingo Park, Meloding, and Ventersburg.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUpgrading of Saulsport Water Treatment Works\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRoadlab is maintaining quality control testing for one of the largest water treatment plant upgrades in Bethlehem, a project spanning 22 months.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/j5xfnfdo/roadlab-municipal-project.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/tyoabxre/roadlab-municipal-project2.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/ysepogsc/roadlab-municipal-project3.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eCommitment to Quality: A SANAS-Accredited Facility\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt Roadlab, quality is what we do. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis commitment to excellence extends beyond compliance—it drives innovation in how we support infrastructure development across the Free State. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBy continuously refining our geotechnical, concrete, and materials testing processes, we help ensure that roads, bridges, water systems, and renewable energy projects are built to last.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur work in this regard and our continued commitment to SANAS accreditation standards ensures that our testing methods, processes, and results remain reliable, trusted, and in accordance with national and international requirements. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe\u0027re ready to answer your questions. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eReach out below.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/og5fdccg/roadlab-bloemfontein-quality-assurance.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/mvrjfbp5/roadlab-quality-assurance.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/lhyhhuro/roadlab-quality-management.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "<p>A trusted laboratory active on the Free State's largest projects, offering the broadest range of testing services for geotechnical and soil investigations, concrete and asphalt evaluations and more quality assurance testing.&nbsp;</p>",
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": []
  }
}]]></Value>
